olution\": \"Integrated into magic tricks and performances over centuries\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Girolamo Cardano\",\n      \"type\": \"Person\",\n      \"description\": \"Girolamo Cardano was an Italian Renaissance mathematician, physician, and magician who incorporated elements of science and mathematics into his magic performances.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Period\": \"Renaissance\",\n        \"Nationality\": \"Italian\",\n        \"Occupations\": \"Mathematician, Physician, Magician\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"geometry\",\n      \"type\": \"Mathematical Discipline\",\n      \"description\": \"Geometry is a branch of mathematics that deals with the properties, measurement, and relationships of points, lines, angles, surfaces, and solids.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Historical Use\": \"Used in the creation of elaborate illusions by early Renaissance magicians\",\n        \"Relevance to Magic\": \"Integral in the development of magic tricks, particularly in the Renaissance period\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"20th century\",\n      \"type\": \"Time Period\",\n      \"description\": \"The 20th century spans from 1901 to 2000 and is marked by significant advancements in technology, science, and culture, including the evolution of magic tricks.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Start Year\": \"1901\",\n        \"End Year\": \"2000\",\n        \"Characteristics\": \"Sophisticated and technologically advanced magic tricks\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"suspense\",\n      \"type\": \"Emotion/Feeling\",\n      \"description\": \"Suspense is a feeling of pleasurable anxiety or anticipation, often used in storytelling and performances to keep the audience engaged and interested.\",\n      \"attributes\": {\n        \"Definition\": \"A feeling of pleasurable anxiety or anticipation\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Magicians\",\n      \"type\": \"Performers\",\n      \